// The Vale of Oaths (story bible §5; M2-16, E4a): a 2 km region. The Academy's vale is its south-west corner, the path Academy →
// Memory Grove → Gathering Meadow → Bogfox Den around the spawn point (256, 256); the Elderwood north of it, the Stormreach
// highlands in the north-west, the Mournfen marsh in the east, the Ashen Reach in the north-east and the Shattered Ring between.
// Biomes shape the ground (inner two thirds fully, fading over the outer third) and set its look; mountains wall the edge.
// Spawners keep each place lived in (also in worlds saved before a place existed); gathering spots are placed at every start.
// The people of Thornwick and the four homes (E5a) stand where they work; a few walk a round.
